      "content": "but that's the thing... i've tried the \"small moments\" and the \"connection\" stuff. i've been doing the work for years. it just feels like i'm trying to patch a sinking ship with scotch tape. sometimes i think maybe the ship was meant to sink. like, what if there isn't a version of me that actually works? what if the \"broken\" part is just who i am now?",
